   "line": [
    "a5"
   ],
   "spoken": "a5 clamps the queenside, making White's textbook b4-c4 hippo expansion very hard to organize.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "a5 to stop the b4-c4 plan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 15,
   "t": 302,
   "fen": "rnbq1rk1/1p3ppp/2pb1n2/p2pp3/8/PPNP2PP/1BP1PPB1/R2QK1NR b KQ - 1 8",
   "line": [
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "White's knight to c3 is out of step with the hippo setup — it just invites us to grab more space.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 16,
   "t": 344.5,
   "fen": "rnbq1rk1/1p3ppp/2pb1n2/p3p3/3p4/PPNP2PP/1BP1PPB1/R2QK1NR w KQ - 0 9",
   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": "So we play d4, seizing space and asking the knight awkward questions — the very reason we put the pawn on c6.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "d4 to gain space and harass the knight"
   ]
  },
  {
