   "t": 371,
   "fen": "rnbq1rk1/5ppp/2pb1n2/pp2p3/N2p4/PP1P2PP/1BP1PPB1/R2QK1NR w KQ - 0 10",
   "line": [
    "b5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The punish is b5 — trapping the knight on a4. This resource is a genuine blind spot that even strong players miss on both sides of the board.",
